  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Perhaps you recall seeing it referenced when you read <ITALICS>The History of the Great Schism</ITALICS>?",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_EMP_10.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254305,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Those who would become the Cabal built it as a lifeboat to usher them through the violent end of the Spiral that they believed inevitable.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_EMP_11.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254305,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "After the Schism, the Spiral Ark was forgotten, until a young man with an incorrigible interest in technology found it here collecting dust.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_EMP_12.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254305,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "As fate would have it, that young man, named Sparck, hails from Empyrea and has dedicated his life to solving the enigma of Empyrean travel.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_EMP_13.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254305,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And despite my many objections, he has volunteered to accompany you on this mission. He is also my brother. But that is inconsequential.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_EMP_14.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254305,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You and Sparck should become acquainted. Here, give him this Ion Dust he requested, and lend him any further aid he may require.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_EMP_15.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254305,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Sparck said that Ion Dust is crucial for some technical thing in the Spiral Ark that I didn't quite understand. Deliver it to him immediately.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_EMP_16.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1254305,
